			"Message": "docs(Common): Refine README formatting and line wrapping\n\nAdjust the `ActionEffect` and dependency injection descriptions in README.md to improve line wrapping and paragraph flow. Remove unnecessary line breaks that interrupted sentence structure, ensuring the text adheres to the clean, narrative style established in previous documentation updates.\n\nThis enhances readability for the core library documentation without altering the architectural descriptions.",
			"SHA": "c2234bb41cbd3d8195e03799b4c8cf02dd319018"
		},
