			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-13T21:16:57Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				355,
				1
			],
			"Message": "docs(Common): Refactor README structure and remove decorative emojis\n\nRewrite the Common README to improve readability and adhere to project styling guidelines. Remove all decorative emojis from headings (e.g., '🏗️', '🔐', '👨🏻‍🏭') and non-breaking space artifacts (e.g., '&#x2001;') to maintain a clean, professional documentation aesthetic.\n\nCompress verbose bullet-point lists into cohesive narrative paragraphs describing the `ActionEffect` system, dependency injection, and transport layers. Update the project structure tree to include new modules (`Telemetry`, `Transport`) and correct formatting for `Configuration`, `IPC`, and `FileSystem` subdirectories. Ensure all links and cross-references remain valid.\n\nThe documentation now focuses on clarity and architectural fidelity without visual clutter.",
			"SHA": "e9c32b7b1dcbf323017ccf83820b30fdd4a7925e"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-13T17:47:38Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				355,
				1
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Common): Disable telemetry reporting by default\n\nChange the default values for `Report`, `Capture`, and `OTLPEnabled` in the Telemetry Configuration from `true` to `false`. This ensures that telemetry data collection and reporting are opt-in rather than opt-out, aligning with privacy-by-default principles.\n\nUsers must now explicitly enable these flags in their configuration to activate the OpenTelemetry pipeline and data capture.",
			"SHA": "0f03f804e1cadc16947c5c0de6096776bd2cab0f"
		},
